flowchart LR
    A(["1. Launch App & Single Tap"]) --> B["2. IMU Bias Calibration (40 Samples @ 50Hz)"]
    B --> C["3. Emit 18-22kHz Ultrasonic Chirp (Speaker)"]
    C --> D["4. Capture 48kHz 16-bit PCM Echo (Mic)"]
    D --> E["5. Time-Gate (<0.5m Cross-Talk Blanked)"]
    E --> F["6A. 1D FFT Cross-Correlation Envelope [2000]"]
    E --> G["6B. 2D Goertzel DFT Spectrogram [64x64]"]
    F & G --> H{"7. ONNX Model Ready?"}
    H -->|Yes| I["8A. Multi-Modal ONNX Transformer Inference"]
    H -->|Fallback| J["8B. Deterministic ToF Peak Heuristic"]
    I & J --> K["9. Fuse with IMU Yaw -> 2D Cartesian SLAM Map (X, Y)"]
    K --> L{"10. Obstacle < 0.6m?"}
    L -->|Yes: Hazard| M["11A. Heavy Haptic Pulse + Priority Interrupt TTS"]
    L -->|No: Safe| N["11B. Queued Spatial Voice + 2D Light Radar UI"]
    M & N --> O{"12. Continue Scan?"}
    O -->|Every 700ms| C
    O -->|User Taps Stop| P(["13. Return to Idle State"])
